  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1901.11 \"Exempt vehicles\" means those vehicles exempt from the requirements for a certificate of title pursuant to RSA 261:3.\n\nSource. #8339, eff 4-26-05 (from Saf-C 1902.08); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12 EXPIRED: 9-27-22\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23",
